iption":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-03-29T15:16:17Z","updated_at":"2025-03-29T15:51:49Z","closed_at":"2025-03-29T15:51:36Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4.1.stable\n- I believe this is a regression, but idk if this was intentional/by design\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7270) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-12100F (8 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nAdvanced Import Settings is a window that shows up when either you double click certain importable resources (like 3d formats) on FileSystem dock, or you click it, go to Import dock, and click the Advanced.. button. When a property is hovered on Advanced Import Settings window (on this example, it was a glb file), it shows this unhelpful tooltip.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7e4e4a7f-7c40-4f58-86da-bfaa8a0a3560)\n\nMeanwhile when the same property is hovered on the import tab, it gives the full details\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1cc81ac0-e8bf-45e8-90e4-dbf7dcb42af0)\n\nThe **expected result** is for every property on Advanced Import Settings window to show the same helpful tooltip as the Import tab counterpart\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- download and open the MRP\n- double click the fox.glb file on FileSystem dock\n- Hover on any property on the right part of the Advanced Import Settings window\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[advanced-import-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19521759/advanced-import-bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104766/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104766/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}